Subset only the font files an edit added, or fail.

pdf_subset_fonts rewrites every embedded font on the pages it looks
at, points a font descriptor at an identical font file it met first,
and leaves a font it cannot cut whole. A signature drawn with a CJK
reason embeds the whole builtin face through the PDF device; Ely
subsets that face before the signing update is written, but must
leave the file's own fonts, and the bytes earlier signatures cover,
untouched, and must not write the whole face silently.
pdf_subset_fonts_from ignores font files numbered below `first` from
the analysis on, and throws when a font cannot be cut.

